WEBVTT

00:41:59.244 --> 00:42:00.783
or even more powerful,

00:42:00.807 --> 00:42:03.450
we'll have to figure out
all kinds of problems,

00:42:03.474 --> 00:42:05.697
such as common sense,

00:42:05.721 --> 00:42:09.032
planning, strategy, creativity,

00:42:09.056 --> 00:42:13.990
ability to feel emotion
and communicate with people effectively.

00:42:14.014 --> 00:42:17.212
In all of these things,
many more breakthroughs are needed --

00:42:17.236 --> 00:42:19.053
we're nowhere close.

00:42:19.077 --> 00:42:22.942
So if we take a look
at where we are with deep learning,

00:42:22.966 --> 00:42:24.357
that's one breakthrough --

00:42:24.381 --> 00:42:27.450
we'll probably need 10 more
breakthroughs like it.

00:42:27.474 --> 00:42:30.903
So to assume we'll have a bunch
more breakthroughs